'''Hospital ships''', also known as '''medcenter ships'''<ref name="Rebel Files">''[[Star Wars: The Rebel Files]]''</ref> or '''medical frigates''',<ref name="RSOWM">''[[Rebel Starfighters Owners' Workshop Manual]]''</ref> were [[Starship|vessels]] used to treat wounded [[soldier]]s. During the [[Clone Wars]], [[Pelta-class frigate|''Pelta''-class frigates]] were used as medical frigates to serve as hospital ships.<ref name="Shadow of Malevolence">{{TCW|Shadow of Malevolence|Shadow of ''Malevolence''}}</ref> When [[clone trooper]] [[Tup]] was required to be sent to [[Kamino]] for a medical evaluation and required protection, [[Medical frigate 517|Medical Frigate 517]], a [[Consular-class cruiser (Charger c70 retrofit)|Republic frigate]], was used.<ref name="The Unknown">{{TCW|The Unknown}}</ref> [[Luke Skywalker]] was treated in [[Redemption|one]] following the [[Duel on Cloud City|duel]] at [[Cloud City]], after [[Anakin Skywalker|Darth Vader]] revealed to Luke that he is indeed his [[Parent|father]], and cut off his right hand.<ref name="Episode V">{{Film|V}}</ref>

